Author: Federico Carrone <mail@fcarrone.com>
Date:   Sun Nov 8 14:12:54 2026 +0000

    tests: add one validated test manifest
---
 .../compiler/{slice0_backends.sh => tests.sh}      |   0
 scripts/checks/lib/test_manifest.py                | 198 +++++++++++++++++++++
 scripts/checks/run.sh                              |   2 +-
 scripts/checks/test_manifest.sh                    |  81 +++++++++
 tests/manifest.tsv                                 |  37 ++++
 5 files changed, 317 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/scripts/checks/compiler/slice0_backends.sh b/scripts/checks/compiler/tests.sh
similarity index 100%
